{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412090","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1141209001:1":{"text":"맛있는 냄새! 뭘 끓이고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"嘿，你们在炖什么！好香啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8BAE904A398E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141209002:1":{"text":"그 손 치워.","source_cn":"把手拿开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD3C4776F4FFC874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141209003:1":{"text":"왜, 아직 안 됐어?","source_cn":"怎么，还没做好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B46FE821C7D8091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141209004:1":{"text":"빈둥거린 사람은 먹을 자격 없어.","source_cn":"不出力的人，没资格吃饭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD66B1D106007672F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141209005:1":{"text":"내가 빈둥거렸다고?! 흥! 두고 봐!","source_cn":"竟敢说我不出力？！瞧着！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E501B90F4DAF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141209006:1":{"text":"잘 봐, 이게 바로 진짜 초코보알이야!","source_cn":"看好了，这可是真正的——陆行鸟蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20D795F673B3850B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1141209006":{"text":"잘 봐, 이게 바로 진짜 초코보알이야!","source_cn":"看好了，这可是真正的——陆行鸟蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20D795F673B3850B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141209007:1":{"text":"그냥 보기만 하라고 했지, 누가 먹으랬어요?!","source_cn":"就是让你们看看，谁说让你们吃了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A6F7CD047D72502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141209008:1":{"text":"어때요? 이렇게 가까이서 초코보의 알을 본 적 없죠?","source_cn":"怎么样？没这么近距离见过陆行鸟的蛋吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4E7E30272C2ACF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141209009:1":{"text":"자! 알에 귀를 대고 잘 들어보면, 아기 새가 안에서 소리도 낸다고요!","source_cn":"你们可以把耳朵贴上去，那小家伙甚至会在里面发出声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x510A2DB4205CF57E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141209010:1":{"text":"... 진짜네, 알 깨는 소리가 나.","source_cn":"……确实，有啄蛋壳的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7D95DD81EE3D18D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1141209011:1":{"text":"... 뭐라고?! 헛!! 곧 나올 건가 봐!","source_cn":"——什么？！那它马上就要出生了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8053CDF653C8F10A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1141209012:1":{"text":"다 그만 먹고, 그 고기 육수 좀 나눠줘! 갓 태어난 새끼 초코보에게 영양가 있는 걸 먹여야 일어설 수 있다고!","source_cn":"喂，别吃了！把锅里的肉汤分我点！得给新出生的小陆行鸟补...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28FFA380AA0D581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1141209013:1":{"text":"...결국... 아무것도 하는 게 없잖아.","source_cn":"……所以，他还是没出力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDCBE36A309A3FD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1141209013":{"text":"...결국... 아무것도 하는 게 없잖아.","source_cn":"……所以，他还是没出力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDCBE36A309A3FD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1141209014:1":{"text":"그래.","source_cn":"好吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F156C79211C33C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn